[case] tests/loop_closure_test.cpp :: loop closure replay: a rejected try changes the edges and the result, an unknown one is named, none changes nothing
  markers: -
  assert: REQUIRE(plain.missing.empty())
  assert: REQUIRE(plain.loops >= 2)
